   "mechanisms_outside_ir": [],
   "notes": "Block ops are written for the 7B configuration, which uses MHA. The 67B uses GQA: 64 heads and 8 KV heads, with K and V projections of reduced width; quote: \"the 67B model uses Grouped-Query Attention (GQA)\". d_ff is given only as the formula \"$\\frac{8}{3}d_{model}$\". That evaluates to a non-integer for d_model = 4096 and the paper gives no rounding, so d_ff and the FFN widths are not_stated. head_dim (presumably 4096/32 = 128) is not stated explicitly. norm eps and rope pairing are left not_stated because they are not given and the cited ancestors LLaMA and LLaMA-2 differ on eps. Biases, untied head, rope_theta 10000 and sequential block are inherited from LLaMA through the sentence \"largely follows the design of LLaMA\"."
  },
